  <div class="guide-reading mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">The copy has finished, but can you do the ordinary things you need on the new computer? A handover is the moment to check the agreed result, record exceptions and make sure you remain in control.</p>
{% include "components/guide-start.njk" %}
<h2 class="mt-12 mb-5 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">Work from the agreed list</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Use the essentials you identified in the <a class="font-semibold text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-ink" href="/guides/new-windows-computer-move-checklist/">move preparation checklist</a>. Check together where possible, with the customer entering their own passwords and authentication codes.</p>
